<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed groups in Libya have disrupted oil supplies by closing the crude valve feeding the Zawiya refinery, while Islamic State militants killed a Christian who refused to renounce Jesus. A study has mapped tuberculosis cases in southern Libya, and the Ministry of Justice has affirmed its regional branches' commitment to improving the justice system. The FIA Islamabad Zone has booked 12 deportees from Libya in a human trafficking case, and UNICEF welcomed Libya's decision to raise the minimum military recruitment age to 18. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOWkZubmhhQUdVZ1llaDU4VFVPby0zaGl0QzM1a1pEU0w5RmxIVDVmSXlfamZmY0g3blVIWmtuUFdPYTZHZHdMUUNQbEtYazlXdGd1Q0owbjNyS0xmQ3lMVjNRcnpQMEFTOV84ejBlNXh6ekxIal93aWV1ZzY3QS0tekFPTnRGdm42ZzNLdEdhUUhhbF9wd3pGaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOVjFWejNpZjAwc0puNlJiS3NGQTZuazVna0hBQkxjcGdyTzVVLXJuVS1DbHY3cFVVZ3JubUNLNWhBLXJmUFl4TGVwRzFLSnZYajFYUWl3MzlGTXBDTXlqbGpENFRKWnpra3owZGJUSHM4M21LV2xJQzJMTnRsWDdkYVZKQmVHT2pQSGwyTFVlbDVjTFozM3JsYlVkSDkxbkVGaEVVYVVTdmxCOGhCdUlCM0E2d1ZhQjF6aTFOTnBB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxObGRrQkxEMG1VdVNGRnVkTUJ2cDhKcnBfSEI1eTUzeWxXMnd1V294THB0XzFqRnhiUWpGM25sTzVHOUNSdC1VLTYxQ2RNWU5zNVRXcm9pWHkzTVcwNjFNVjRKU2gwTVpHcjZ4Yk1VVV9fMklCRVlkeTB0Vm1BYW04bTV4RHNmUF9Bbzg0dFN5WEFDSWpsQnhnbFg4MVRJRVlFOEVKMzBBVkw2dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTFBzME0teFZwSlhzbTdTb0lWdUktMlVJTExLSUFSaDVXZUlBamtfdHVEekJoSEJQZmJVUnFNQ2djSzhuY1ZHWlhqLVlmcUlKWW5UVS1KSGxjUHE3Z3J0M041N2VMSkhCUdIBZkFVX3lxTFBzME0teFZwSlhzbTdTb0lWdUktMlVJTExLSUFSaDVXZUlBamtfdHVEekJoSE